(2494151, 344200, 24073, '<td valign="top">Not green enough, and it feels like too much is going on.  I am a rose freak, I love them completely, and can never see enough of them.  Here though the color that I love so much is faint, and it feels flat.  The other thing that I love about roses, is the smell, and when I scratch the screen it doesn''t smell. :)lol.</td>', 'Not green enough, and it feels like too much is going on.  I am a rose freak, I love them completely, and can never see enough of them.  Here though the color that I love so much is faint, and it feels flat.  The other thing that I love about roses, is the smell, and when I scratch the screen it doesn''t smell. :)lol.', '2006-06-07 10:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2494154, 343881, 39670, '<td valign="top">GREEN???</td>', 'GREEN???', '2006-06-07 10:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
