(2494218, 343734, 24073, '<td valign="top">Im not scared, I will jump in there and wrestle that gator anyday.  Definately Green thats for sure, you definately get all those points.  Something isn''t making it popout though.  For me just one of those photos that stays right above average.  GL.  Maybe a gradient on each side if that is allowed would of gave this more stand out potential.</td>', 'Im not scared, I will jump in there and wrestle that gator anyday.  Definately Green thats for sure, you definately get all those points.  Something isn''t making it popout though.  For me just one of those photos that stays right above average.  GL.  Maybe a gradient on each side if that is allowed would of gave this more stand out potential.', '2006-06-07 10:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2494219, 343554, 47534, '<td valign="top">Grrrrrrr.....this one is a struggle for me - do I vote really low because it the photo itself doesn''t fit the challenge, or do I vote really high because it took guts and creativity to use this photo with such a title?  <br/> <br/>Ya know, I''m not even sure what a green-colorblind person WOULD see, but somehow this isn''t JUST a cheap gimmick to win - I''m giving it a 9...especially since I am so horrible at titling my pics!</td>', 'Grrrrrrr.....this one is a struggle for me - do I vote really low because it the photo itself doesn''t fit the challenge, or do I vote really high because it took guts and creativity to use this photo with such a title?   Ya know, I''m not even sure what a green-colorblind person WOULD see, but somehow this isn''t JUST a cheap gimmick to win - I''m giving it a 9...especially since I am so horrible at titling my pics!', '2006-06-07 10:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
