(2494299, 343332, 24073, '<td valign="top">notta, this doesnt work.  Not for me anyway.  Im sure you know what I am talking about, the rose in the front has to go.  Other than that, I am really drawn to liking this photo, I think you may of been on to something with real potential.  I think its the whispy clean feeling it gives.  I would absolutely love to see that rose, or maybe even a sunflower right dead center of the grass (in focus), I bet that would be sweet.</td>', 'notta, this doesnt work.  Not for me anyway.  Im sure you know what I am talking about, the rose in the front has to go.  Other than that, I am really drawn to liking this photo, I think you may of been on to something with real potential.  I think its the whispy clean feeling it gives.  I would absolutely love to see that rose, or maybe even a sunflower right dead center of the grass (in focus), I bet that would be sweet.', '2006-06-07 11:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
