(2495217, 344337, 8860, '<td valign="top">This image suffers from a lack of focal point. We''re too distant from your subject. Getting much closer and picking out a detail would give the viewer something to find rather than scanning your whole scene for a fragment of interest. You have some good lighting here so it''s a shame not to make use of it.<br/> <br/>You could try:<br/>&gt; shooting into the sun through a leaf<br/>&gt; creating negative space from leaf and branch shapes<br/>&gt; finding intense light/shadow in texture on leaves<br/>&gt; shooting at an extreme angle either from base of trunk/branch or looking down from above<br/>&gt; try creating exaggerated bokeh by using your zoom and focusing on a small aspect of subject<br/> <br/>Sadly, you will get hammered in the voting but put it down to experience and move on. I have given this a 3 because of the above points and the overexposure in the sky.</td>', 'This image suffers from a lack of focal point. We''re too distant from your subject. Getting much closer and picking out a detail would give the viewer something to find rather than scanning your whole scene for a fragment of interest. You have some good lighting here so it''s a shame not to make use of it. You could try:> shooting into the sun through a leaf> creating negative space from leaf and branch shapes> finding intense light/shadow in texture on leaves> shooting at an extreme angle either from base of trunk/branch or looking down from above> try creating exaggerated bokeh by using your zoom and focusing on a small aspect of subject Sadly, you will get hammered in the voting but put it down to experience and move on. I have given this a 3 because of the above points and the overexposure in the sky.', '2006-06-07 15:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2495218, 343603, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.</td>', 'Very beautiful.', '2006-06-07 15:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
