(2496743, 343751, 46330, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but you need some sort of light source shining up on the leaves, like fill flash or even a flashlight.  The dynamic range, the difference between highlights (sky) and shadows (leaves), is too much for your sensor to capture and this doesn''t work as a silhouette.</td>', 'Nice idea, but you need some sort of light source shining up on the leaves, like fill flash or even a flashlight.  The dynamic range, the difference between highlights (sky) and shadows (leaves), is too much for your sensor to capture and this doesn''t work as a silhouette.', '2006-06-07 22:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
