(2498164, 342741, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice image indeed.  Too many in this challenge to comment on really so have not done as many as I usually do.  However, this one attracts.  Though certainly not nearly as overtly green as many of those leaf photos, this is interesting and tells a story of sorts.  Glad to see something different.</td>', 'Nice image indeed.  Too many in this challenge to comment on really so have not done as many as I usually do.  However, this one attracts.  Though certainly not nearly as overtly green as many of those leaf photos, this is interesting and tells a story of sorts.  Glad to see something different.', '2006-06-08 09:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
