(2498186, 344494, 24073, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea.  Ideas like this keep me intrigued.  I will give you the points for uniqueness, and the points for green, and even the points for technically right.  The prop though gets -1 for the dents and dings at the bottom.  Overall, incredible shot 9.</td>', 'Very cool idea.  Ideas like this keep me intrigued.  I will give you the points for uniqueness, and the points for green, and even the points for technically right.  The prop though gets -1 for the dents and dings at the bottom.  Overall, incredible shot 9.', '2006-06-08 09:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
