(2499461, 344175, 24991, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I figured that there would be a few submissions like this, but I relly find the way you pulled it off visually pleasing.  The only negative thing I have to say about it is that appears that the plant might actually not be within your depth of field, and the focus is just infront of it on the dirt.</td>', 'Very nice.  I figured that there would be a few submissions like this, but I relly find the way you pulled it off visually pleasing.  The only negative thing I have to say about it is that appears that the plant might actually not be within your depth of field, and the focus is just infront of it on the dirt.', '2006-06-08 17:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
