(2499473, 344412, 50641, '<td valign="top">This would win if I were king... or even a prince.   Wonderfully whimsical and technically splendid too.</td>', 'This would win if I were king... or even a prince.   Wonderfully whimsical and technically splendid too.', '2006-06-08 17:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499489, 343121, 50641, '<td valign="top">Congratulations  - this is a wonderful picture with timeless qualities.  I could see it being on the cover of Life magazine of almost any year.  I love her pose (great mimic), the position of her feet and where the umbrella lies in your crop.  I love how they are both facing away from us. I''m guessing that there''s a chance this won''t be processed enough for some people here.  I''m fine with its realism but suppose you could play around with the curves/up the contrast a little, perhaps bring out the red in her hair.  But still, this is a wonderfully clean, evocative photo.  Gets a ribbon in my book ;-)</td>', 'Congratulations  - this is a wonderful picture with timeless qualities.  I could see it being on the cover of Life magazine of almost any year.  I love her pose (great mimic), the position of her feet and where the umbrella lies in your crop.  I love how they are both facing away from us. I''m guessing that there''s a chance this won''t be processed enough for some people here.  I''m fine with its realism but suppose you could play around with the curves/up the contrast a little, perhaps bring out the red in her hair.  But still, this is a wonderfully clean, evocative photo.  Gets a ribbon in my book ;-)', '2006-06-08 17:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499496, 344043, 50641, '<td valign="top">Even though groundhogs are evil garden wreckers, I like your photo.  I love his spikey hair and the catch of motion.  Good composition too.</td>', 'Even though groundhogs are evil garden wreckers, I like your photo.  I love his spikey hair and the catch of motion.  Good composition too.', '2006-06-08 17:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
