(2500229, 344481, 12857, '<td valign="top">Great idea and great colors.  I would have liked it better with a more natural arrangement of the fruit.  You know like when you come home from the market and throw everything in the bowl. The lighting is PERFECT!!!! and your focus is tack sharp.  Great job.  8</td>', 'Great idea and great colors.  I would have liked it better with a more natural arrangement of the fruit.  You know like when you come home from the market and throw everything in the bowl. The lighting is PERFECT!!!! and your focus is tack sharp.  Great job.  8', '2006-06-08 22:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500232, 342920, 52195, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2006-06-08 22:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500233, 340819, 48228, '<td valign="top">Border seems to heavy for the image...</td>', 'Border seems to heavy for the image...', '2006-06-08 22:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500242, 343428, 12857, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.  I wish the challenge would have allowed you to clone out the brown.  I think I would have liked more saturation. Still a 9 <br/>dc</td>', 'Simply beautiful.  I wish the challenge would have allowed you to clone out the brown.  I think I would have liked more saturation. Still a 9 dc', '2006-06-08 22:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500246, 344469, 12857, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Macro on this is spectacular. Great DOF and Great focus.   I did not realize that the  spors on these ferns were cone shape.  Thanks for sharing <br/>dc</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Macro on this is spectacular. Great DOF and Great focus.   I did not realize that the  spors on these ferns were cone shape.  Thanks for sharing dc', '2006-06-08 22:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
