(2500275, 344290, 43844, '<td valign="top">Love it.  The shape brings an abstract feel to this and the curves lend well to a thin frame.  Nice job.</td>', 'Love it.  The shape brings an abstract feel to this and the curves lend well to a thin frame.  Nice job.', '2006-06-08 22:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500279, 342615, 43844, '<td valign="top">One of very very few landscape shots that have amazed me in this challenge.  Nicely done.</td>', 'One of very very few landscape shots that have amazed me in this challenge.  Nicely done.', '2006-06-08 22:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500282, 342614, 43844, '<td valign="top">Simple, well done.</td>', 'Simple, well done.', '2006-06-08 22:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500284, 342929, 43844, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast with the ground.  Good compo.</td>', 'I like the contrast with the ground.  Good compo.', '2006-06-08 22:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500286, 343458, 43844, '<td valign="top">Crisp!  Nice DOF.</td>', 'Crisp!  Nice DOF.', '2006-06-08 22:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500287, 342680, 43844, '<td valign="top">Softest picture of the challenge.  Great crop, great colors.  Should be some sort of poster for a Botanical Garden.</td>', 'Softest picture of the challenge.  Great crop, great colors.  Should be some sort of poster for a Botanical Garden.', '2006-06-08 22:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500288, 342756, 43844, '<td valign="top">Good idea and well executed.  I think that the string alone evokes enough thought.  I would have done without the bug, or am I missing the point?  Great job nonetheless.  Like it.</td>', 'Good idea and well executed.  I think that the string alone evokes enough thought.  I would have done without the bug, or am I missing the point?  Great job nonetheless.  Like it.', '2006-06-08 22:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500290, 342764, 43844, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, what is it about strawberries that draws you in?  Nicely done.</td>', 'Hmmm, what is it about strawberries that draws you in?  Nicely done.', '2006-06-08 22:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500291, 343602, 43844, '<td valign="top">Good way to bring green into the foreground despite the flower''s focal strength.  Leaves just wouldn''t have done it.</td>', 'Good way to bring green into the foreground despite the flower''s focal strength.  Leaves just wouldn''t have done it.', '2006-06-08 22:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500293, 344509, 43844, '<td valign="top">Good shot, nice angle, crisp quality.</td>', 'Good shot, nice angle, crisp quality.', '2006-06-08 22:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500294, 342892, 43844, '<td valign="top">Dark tones, unusual leaf - all works well IMO.</td>', 'Dark tones, unusual leaf - all works well IMO.', '2006-06-08 22:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500295, 342529, 43844, '<td valign="top">Different, great shot.</td>', 'Different, great shot.', '2006-06-08 22:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500299, 341303, 43844, '<td valign="top">Cool.  The only praying mantis of the challenge I think.  Instant winner!</td>', 'Cool.  The only praying mantis of the challenge I think.  Instant winner!', '2006-06-08 22:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500303, 344369, 43844, '<td valign="top">One of the few shots to select green and make it work without looking like its overdone.  Beautiful landscape.</td>', 'One of the few shots to select green and make it work without looking like its overdone.  Beautiful landscape.', '2006-06-08 22:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500305, 343989, 43844, '<td valign="top">Nice way to pull that one off.</td>', 'Nice way to pull that one off.', '2006-06-08 22:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500315, 343458, 57658, '<td valign="top">A closer crop might help - everything in the top half is out of focus and doesn''t add much. If you were trying to bring out the texture in the leaf - perhaps backlighting it might have helped. Its an interesting green but to me there is nothing in the picture that grabs my attention - perhaps a crop with the red vein as the diagonal</td>', 'A closer crop might help - everything in the top half is out of focus and doesn''t add much. If you were trying to bring out the texture in the leaf - perhaps backlighting it might have helped. Its an interesting green but to me there is nothing in the picture that grabs my attention - perhaps a crop with the red vein as the diagonal', '2006-06-08 22:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500325, 342982, 57658, '<td valign="top">Well taken shot of the scenery but perhaps the challenge is better met by focussing on the moss on the rock or the stump rather than the river ?</td>', 'Well taken shot of the scenery but perhaps the challenge is better met by focussing on the moss on the rock or the stump rather than the river ?', '2006-06-08 22:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500327, 343116, 46330, '<td valign="top">I love the composition but I''m not a big fan of the eyeliner.</td>', 'I love the composition but I''m not a big fan of the eyeliner.', '2006-06-08 22:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500328, 344224, 57658, '<td valign="top">All the greens are out of focus and just supporting elements ... nice view though.</td>', 'All the greens are out of focus and just supporting elements ... nice view though.', '2006-06-08 22:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500337, 343603, 46330, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and eye contact but the eyes are a bit soft.  They would benefit from either refocusing, or, since there''s no distracting background, using a smaller aperture to increase DOF.</td>', 'Nice composition and eye contact but the eyes are a bit soft.  They would benefit from either refocusing, or, since there''s no distracting background, using a smaller aperture to increase DOF.', '2006-06-08 22:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500338, 343776, 57658, '<td valign="top">Nicely done . Good balance between exposing the veins correctly and still trying to get light through the peas and not leave them looking as black globs</td>', 'Nicely done . Good balance between exposing the veins correctly and still trying to get light through the peas and not leave them looking as black globs', '2006-06-08 22:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500341, 344168, 57658, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - must have been a difficult choice deciding between this and a macro shot of the horse''s main to bring out the green</td>', 'Nice idea - must have been a difficult choice deciding between this and a macro shot of the horse''s main to bring out the green', '2006-06-08 22:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500342, 343910, 46651, '<td valign="top">This is such a great shot!</td>', 'This is such a great shot!', '2006-06-08 22:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500343, 343600, 46330, '<td valign="top">I like the clean simplicity and minimalism of this.  Nicely seen.</td>', 'I like the clean simplicity and minimalism of this.  Nicely seen.', '2006-06-08 22:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
