(2500359, 344417, 57658, '<td valign="top">Nice simple idea for the challenge and well executed - where are the lights ? I like how the paint draws your eye to the can and the amount of breathing space it has. Good composition</td>', 'Nice simple idea for the challenge and well executed - where are the lights ? I like how the paint draws your eye to the can and the amount of breathing space it has. Good composition', '2006-06-08 22:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
