(2500591, 344310, 50641, '<td valign="top">Wow, are those hops or just ivy?  I''m terribly jealous of your growing season.  Just getting started here on the East Coast.  Like the splashes of red in the photo and the novel subject.</td>', 'Wow, are those hops or just ivy?  I''m terribly jealous of your growing season.  Just getting started here on the East Coast.  Like the splashes of red in the photo and the novel subject.', '2006-06-08 23:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
