(2500616, 343497, 41574, '<td valign="top">I think the contrast is just a bit too high here. The extreme dark at the bottom is pleasing, but utterly over-powered by the blown-out center. A little more saturation might have helper, but, even then, I''m not sure by how much. An OK shot, that doesn''t quite "do it" for me.</td>', 'I think the contrast is just a bit too high here. The extreme dark at the bottom is pleasing, but utterly over-powered by the blown-out center. A little more saturation might have helper, but, even then, I''m not sure by how much. An OK shot, that doesn''t quite "do it" for me.', '2006-06-09 00:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500620, 344294, 41574, '<td valign="top">I love the crispness of the hand, but the rest of the image (as a whole) is "so-so."</td>', 'I love the crispness of the hand, but the rest of the image (as a whole) is "so-so."', '2006-06-09 00:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500628, 343502, 41574, '<td valign="top">Sute kid, but it (the picture) looks more like a (decent) "snap-shot" more than anything else. The flash makes for flat lighting, and a softer focus (or wider aperture for a more out-of-focus background) might have been pleasing.</td>', 'Sute kid, but it (the picture) looks more like a (decent) "snap-shot" more than anything else. The flash makes for flat lighting, and a softer focus (or wider aperture for a more out-of-focus background) might have been pleasing.', '2006-06-09 00:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500631, 344477, 41574, '<td valign="top">Honestly, I can''t even really tell what I''m looking at. It''s not bad, bit it''s not great, either.</td>', 'Honestly, I can''t even really tell what I''m looking at. It''s not bad, bit it''s not great, either.', '2006-06-09 00:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500639, 342633, 41574, '<td valign="top">Focus goes too soft toward infinity, and the difference between the highlights and the shadows appears too great to be pleasing. It looks as though you were before a beautiful scene, but, unfortunately, this photograph doesn''t capture things very enchantingly.</td>', 'Focus goes too soft toward infinity, and the difference between the highlights and the shadows appears too great to be pleasing. It looks as though you were before a beautiful scene, but, unfortunately, this photograph doesn''t capture things very enchantingly.', '2006-06-09 00:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500640, 344369, 57658, '<td valign="top">All right ... how ? :D - a color filter ?</td>', 'All right ... how ? :D - a color filter ?', '2006-06-09 00:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500647, 343599, 41574, '<td valign="top">I think that the bike''s being dead center (horizontally) makes for an uninteresting picture. Other than this, the framing is nice, but, overall, the shot doesn''t do very much for me.</td>', 'I think that the bike''s being dead center (horizontally) makes for an uninteresting picture. Other than this, the framing is nice, but, overall, the shot doesn''t do very much for me.', '2006-06-09 00:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500649, 344484, 41574, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what I''m looking at, but it seems to be less sharp than I''d like it to be. Overall, the shot does very little for me.</td>', 'I''m not sure what I''m looking at, but it seems to be less sharp than I''d like it to be. Overall, the shot does very little for me.', '2006-06-09 00:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
