(2502242, 343943, 8860, '<td valign="top">A great scene - obviously. I just wish you could have done a little more with it. There is is such depth in the scene here that I think you could have exageerated it further by putting the camera on the ground and getting hyperfocus on distance and grass blades in foreground. As it stands, I do believe that most photographers would have achieved the same result thanks to the subject. It''s still a nice photo though, I''m just being critical!</td>', 'A great scene - obviously. I just wish you could have done a little more with it. There is is such depth in the scene here that I think you could have exageerated it further by putting the camera on the ground and getting hyperfocus on distance and grass blades in foreground. As it stands, I do believe that most photographers would have achieved the same result thanks to the subject. It''s still a nice photo though, I''m just being critical!', '2006-06-09 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
