(2503870, 343483, 59415, '<td valign="top">The butterfly is a bit centered for my personal taste.  And the greens of the leaves are sort of washed out.  I feel the image could be better if maybe it had a bit more contrast, and the shadows were a bit more bold giving the image a bit of depth.  Also I would have possibly changed the dof to either show the background objects or blur them further.</td>', 'The butterfly is a bit centered for my personal taste.  And the greens of the leaves are sort of washed out.  I feel the image could be better if maybe it had a bit more contrast, and the shadows were a bit more bold giving the image a bit of depth.  Also I would have possibly changed the dof to either show the background objects or blur them further.', '2006-06-10 01:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
