(2506057, 344277, 56673, '<td valign="top">Red water worries me a bit.  Love the blue sky though.</td>', 'Red water worries me a bit.  Love the blue sky though.', '2006-06-11 02:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506063, 342246, 56673, '<td valign="top">Great job.  I think it adds so much life and interest to the pictures to put a person in.  A boring "green liquid in a glass" picture really pops when you introduce the red lips of a mystery woman.</td>', 'Great job.  I think it adds so much life and interest to the pictures to put a person in.  A boring "green liquid in a glass" picture really pops when you introduce the red lips of a mystery woman.', '2006-06-11 02:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506064, 344356, 56673, '<td valign="top">Blurry.</td>', 'Blurry.', '2006-06-11 02:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506068, 342217, 56673, '<td valign="top">Probably too little!  And too dark.</td>', 'Probably too little!  And too dark.', '2006-06-11 02:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506072, 342982, 56673, '<td valign="top">A little leech is worth it to get the shot.  As long as he''s on your leg and not mine.  Very nice.  And good choice not to dial up the green too much in post processing.</td>', 'A little leech is worth it to get the shot.  As long as he''s on your leg and not mine.  Very nice.  And good choice not to dial up the green too much in post processing.', '2006-06-11 02:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506074, 343839, 56673, '<td valign="top">Boy I love a good waterfall!  Wonderful.</td>', 'Boy I love a good waterfall!  Wonderful.', '2006-06-11 02:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506080, 342693, 20256, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great place to take a hike!</td>', 'Looks like a great place to take a hike!', '2006-06-11 02:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506081, 342210, 56673, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic.</td>', 'Very dramatic.', '2006-06-11 02:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506086, 342823, 56673, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful forest.  The colors, lighting and clear focus are all postives.  I feel like you need something else in the shot as a focal point, however.  An unusual tree, or a rock, pond, river, deer.  Something to set off and accentuate the green wave of trees.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful forest.  The colors, lighting and clear focus are all postives.  I feel like you need something else in the shot as a focal point, however.  An unusual tree, or a rock, pond, river, deer.  Something to set off and accentuate the green wave of trees.', '2006-06-11 02:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506088, 342868, 56673, '<td valign="top">The red accents really add to the shot.  Nicely done.</td>', 'The red accents really add to the shot.  Nicely done.', '2006-06-11 02:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506089, 342948, 56673, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.</td>', 'Out of focus.', '2006-06-11 02:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506091, 342680, 59781, '<td valign="top">Love the soft tones</td>', 'Love the soft tones', '2006-06-11 02:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506093, 342702, 56673, '<td valign="top">More brown than green, at least on my monitor.</td>', 'More brown than green, at least on my monitor.', '2006-06-11 02:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506094, 343034, 59781, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the longer exposure</td>', 'I like the use of the longer exposure', '2006-06-11 02:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506096, 344481, 56673, '<td valign="top">Such a wonderful job on the lighting!</td>', 'Such a wonderful job on the lighting!', '2006-06-11 02:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506098, 342698, 56673, '<td valign="top">Yeah, that''s creepy.</td>', 'Yeah, that''s creepy.', '2006-06-11 02:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506100, 344050, 20256, '<td valign="top">Very creative!</td>', 'Very creative!', '2006-06-11 02:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506101, 343672, 56673, '<td valign="top">The well seems a little tilted.</td>', 'The well seems a little tilted.', '2006-06-11 02:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506105, 343994, 56673, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Colors are very nice, image is crisp, perspective is good.</td>', 'Well done.  Colors are very nice, image is crisp, perspective is good.', '2006-06-11 02:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506109, 343371, 56673, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised there weren''t more golf themed shots.  I think you migh improve the composition of this one.  Maybe add some action by having the club address the ball.  The feet distract me a bit.  There doesn''t seem to be a clear focal point.</td>', 'I''m surprised there weren''t more golf themed shots.  I think you migh improve the composition of this one.  Maybe add some action by having the club address the ball.  The feet distract me a bit.  There doesn''t seem to be a clear focal point.', '2006-06-11 02:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506113, 344043, 56673, '<td valign="top">Good panning shot.  Caught him in mid air.</td>', 'Good panning shot.  Caught him in mid air.', '2006-06-11 02:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506114, 344477, 56673, '<td valign="top">Hard to rate since I''m not sure what I''m supposed to be seeing.</td>', 'Hard to rate since I''m not sure what I''m supposed to be seeing.', '2006-06-11 02:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506116, 342698, 57658, '<td valign="top">I think you tried to do too much on this. Just the braids would have been good. The eyes is a nice touch but a little over the top. The thumbnail pops but the full image - well .. you can see the eyes and the focus of the image changes.</td>', 'I think you tried to do too much on this. Just the braids would have been good. The eyes is a nice touch but a little over the top. The thumbnail pops but the full image - well .. you can see the eyes and the focus of the image changes.', '2006-06-11 02:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506119, 343737, 56673, '<td valign="top">I haven''t tried many panning shots.  It looks like it muct be hard to get right.  But the feeling of motion is very vivid.</td>', 'I haven''t tried many panning shots.  It looks like it muct be hard to get right.  But the feeling of motion is very vivid.', '2006-06-11 02:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506120, 343082, 49460, '<td valign="top">Creepy. It looks like the house is smiling at you.</td>', 'Creepy. It looks like the house is smiling at you.', '2006-06-11 02:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506122, 342179, 56673, '<td valign="top">Simplistic ... but unique.</td>', 'Simplistic ... but unique.', '2006-06-11 02:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506126, 344353, 56673, '<td valign="top">Whoa.  Don''t look down!  This appears to be a dramatic set of falls.  I wonder if there might be a better angle to capture it?  Shooting from this perspective kind of flattens the whole thing out.</td>', 'Whoa.  Don''t look down!  This appears to be a dramatic set of falls.  I wonder if there might be a better angle to capture it?  Shooting from this perspective kind of flattens the whole thing out.', '2006-06-11 02:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506128, 343636, 56673, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2006-06-11 03:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506129, 343719, 56673, '<td valign="top">I''m Gumby dammit!</td>', 'I''m Gumby dammit!', '2006-06-11 03:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506130, 343187, 56673, '<td valign="top">This is just fabulous.  So many elements that you go just right.  The only negative is the skin tones went a little green too - but hard to fix within basic editing.</td>', 'This is just fabulous.  So many elements that you go just right.  The only negative is the skin tones went a little green too - but hard to fix within basic editing.', '2006-06-11 03:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
