(2506308, 343082, 58947, '<td valign="top">This photo - the expression on the house''s face - everything - is such an enigma. Well done! :-)</td>', 'This photo - the expression on the house''s face - everything - is such an enigma. Well done! :-)', '2006-06-11 08:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
