(2506310, 343187, 58947, '<td valign="top">Oh, wow! What a gorgeous shot of a gorgeous subject! Adorable. :-D</td>', 'Oh, wow! What a gorgeous shot of a gorgeous subject! Adorable. :-D', '2006-06-11 08:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506311, 344156, 58947, '<td valign="top">This is so unusual. I once gave a gift like this to an old friend - it was a small soft green succulent growing on a piece of rose quartz. That was almost 20 years ago, and I''ve never seen anything like it until this photograph. Just beautiful. :-)</td>', 'This is so unusual. I once gave a gift like this to an old friend - it was a small soft green succulent growing on a piece of rose quartz. That was almost 20 years ago, and I''ve never seen anything like it until this photograph. Just beautiful. :-)', '2006-06-11 08:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506314, 344287, 58947, '<td valign="top">I like this. The play of light and shadow create movement, and I can almost hear a warm sea breeze rattling the palms.</td>', 'I like this. The play of light and shadow create movement, and I can almost hear a warm sea breeze rattling the palms.', '2006-06-11 08:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506315, 342012, 58947, '<td valign="top">I like the colours in this, although I''m not too fond of the stark white background. This has a fun and colourful party feel to it, and I''m definitely partial to anything that makes me feel invited. :-)</td>', 'I like the colours in this, although I''m not too fond of the stark white background. This has a fun and colourful party feel to it, and I''m definitely partial to anything that makes me feel invited. :-)', '2006-06-11 08:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506316, 341305, 58947, '<td valign="top">I know nothing about the technical aspects of photography, I only know what my eye likes. I like this image, though I don''t think it is a particularly great photograph. I think that what I like about it is that although it is set in India(?), the muted hues and soft light remind me a little of the English painter, John Constable.</td>', 'I know nothing about the technical aspects of photography, I only know what my eye likes. I like this image, though I don''t think it is a particularly great photograph. I think that what I like about it is that although it is set in India(?), the muted hues and soft light remind me a little of the English painter, John Constable.', '2006-06-11 08:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506319, 344145, 58947, '<td valign="top">I love this. Great shot!</td>', 'I love this. Great shot!', '2006-06-11 08:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506321, 343947, 9668, '<td valign="top">Love it! Gorgeaus lines. 8</td>', 'Love it! Gorgeaus lines. 8', '2006-06-11 08:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506322, 344424, 58947, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm...this doesn''t really do anything for me, I''m sorry.</td>', 'Mmmmm...this doesn''t really do anything for me, I''m sorry.', '2006-06-11 08:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506324, 344290, 58947, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is quite other-worldly. Nice!</td>', 'Wow, this is quite other-worldly. Nice!', '2006-06-11 08:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506332, 344394, 9668, '<td valign="top">Cool! Took me a little bit to figure it out, but it''s really cool. was a little deeper DOF possible?</td>', 'Cool! Took me a little bit to figure it out, but it''s really cool. was a little deeper DOF possible?', '2006-06-11 08:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506333, 344350, 9668, '<td valign="top">Like the touch of the purple flower. Think it adds a lot to the image.</td>', 'Like the touch of the purple flower. Think it adds a lot to the image.', '2006-06-11 08:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
