(2508245, 344509, 9668, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is sharp (maybe too much so). Nice focus, like to see a bit of yellow  and purple in this photo as well as green of course.</td>', 'Wow, this is sharp (maybe too much so). Nice focus, like to see a bit of yellow  and purple in this photo as well as green of course.', '2006-06-12 02:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
