(2508541, 344476, 29535, '<td valign="top">The couple could have been photographed in a slightly better position but aside form that a good fit for the challenge and a nice photo.</td>', 'The couple could have been photographed in a slightly better position but aside form that a good fit for the challenge and a nice photo.', '2006-06-12 05:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
