(2510735, 342677, 10818, '<td valign="top">Wonderful nature shot.  Very green, and of coarse the waterfall is a wonderful background.</td>', 'Wonderful nature shot.  Very green, and of coarse the waterfall is a wonderful background.', '2006-06-12 22:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2510738, 342456, 42869, '<td valign="top">Good color depth on how the green tones of the leaves match the greens of the snake.  I like the juxtaposition of the straight branches with the curve of the snake as well - good contrasting lines.  I might have lightened the levels on the shadows a bit to make the underside of the snakes head not quite so dark, but that''s just me - nice capture.</td>', 'Good color depth on how the green tones of the leaves match the greens of the snake.  I like the juxtaposition of the straight branches with the curve of the snake as well - good contrasting lines.  I might have lightened the levels on the shadows a bit to make the underside of the snakes head not quite so dark, but that''s just me - nice capture.', '2006-06-12 22:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2510744, 344443, 10818, '<td valign="top">I was going to do a shot like that, but I only had 7 dollars.  :)<br/> <br/>Cool shot, well done.</td>', 'I was going to do a shot like that, but I only had 7 dollars.  :) Cool shot, well done.', '2006-06-12 22:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
