(2511683, 341857, 9668, '<td valign="top">Left headlight out, or did you use a blinker? Or is just reflection? I expected to see more duotone green images in this challenge, but as far as I know, this is the only one I''ve seen so far (which is cool). Nice pespective and composition.</td>', 'Left headlight out, or did you use a blinker? Or is just reflection? I expected to see more duotone green images in this challenge, but as far as I know, this is the only one I''ve seen so far (which is cool). Nice pespective and composition.', '2006-06-13 03:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2511685, 344472, 9668, '<td valign="top">Cool waterfall shot! Think it may have a little more impact if it was shot at a different time of day (like early morning or late evening) to make the colors punch more, but I don''t know if that was possible. Nice composition though.</td>', 'Cool waterfall shot! Think it may have a little more impact if it was shot at a different time of day (like early morning or late evening) to make the colors punch more, but I don''t know if that was possible. Nice composition though.', '2006-06-13 03:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2511686, 343600, 9668, '<td valign="top">It almost looked like the bow of a ship heading into a green ocean. This photo isn''t very exciting to me. I mean, it''s some basic shapes and a bit of color, but I dont'' want to look at it for more than a few seconds because there isn''t much going on.</td>', 'It almost looked like the bow of a ship heading into a green ocean. This photo isn''t very exciting to me. I mean, it''s some basic shapes and a bit of color, but I dont'' want to look at it for more than a few seconds because there isn''t much going on.', '2006-06-13 03:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2511688, 343499, 9668, '<td valign="top">I''ve never photographed a poison dart frog before so that is cool, but the image quality doesn''t look very high. I don''t know if it was possible to get any closer, but that might have helped, or shooting it with more light.</td>', 'I''ve never photographed a poison dart frog before so that is cool, but the image quality doesn''t look very high. I don''t know if it was possible to get any closer, but that might have helped, or shooting it with more light.', '2006-06-13 03:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
