(2513173, 344428, 43158, '<td valign="top"><i></i></td>', '', '2006-06-13 15:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513245, 343072, 52731, '<td valign="top">Play with the curves on this and you will have a stunning shot. ;)</td>', 'Play with the curves on this and you will have a stunning shot. ;)', '2006-06-13 16:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513246, 341219, 52731, '<td valign="top">This has a lovely mood to it.</td>', 'This has a lovely mood to it.', '2006-06-13 16:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513250, 343100, 52731, '<td valign="top">Really neat. I like the close crop.</td>', 'Really neat. I like the close crop.', '2006-06-13 16:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513255, 344388, 52731, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, you''ve made leaves have emotion. Good work!</td>', 'This is beautiful, you''ve made leaves have emotion. Good work!', '2006-06-13 16:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513262, 343536, 52731, '<td valign="top">Everything about this is factastic, the colours, the clarity, the DOF. Technically flawless and also very interesting to look at. a 10.</td>', 'Everything about this is factastic, the colours, the clarity, the DOF. Technically flawless and also very interesting to look at. a 10.', '2006-06-13 16:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513264, 344432, 60478, '<td valign="top">I like the subtlety of the color changes.</td>', 'I like the subtlety of the color changes.', '2006-06-13 16:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513267, 344210, 46314, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred it if it had been cropped a little tighter, to make the center stand out a bit more. But liked the idea.</td>', 'Would have preferred it if it had been cropped a little tighter, to make the center stand out a bit more. But liked the idea.', '2006-06-13 16:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513271, 343989, 52731, '<td valign="top">This one is messing with my eyes. Neat.</td>', 'This one is messing with my eyes. Neat.', '2006-06-13 16:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513275, 343940, 46314, '<td valign="top">I liked how the shadow parallels the, er, object (what is that anyway?)</td>', 'I liked how the shadow parallels the, er, object (what is that anyway?)', '2006-06-13 16:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513279, 344485, 46314, '<td valign="top">Beautiful coastline. Just a pity the sky got blown out.</td>', 'Beautiful coastline. Just a pity the sky got blown out.', '2006-06-13 16:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513289, 344297, 46314, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for landscapes... Nice focus.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for landscapes... Nice focus.', '2006-06-13 16:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513294, 341707, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice colour and idea, but would have preferred a simpler composition. And unlucky that the rabbit is sitting in that shadow where he gets a bit muted in the image.</td>', 'Nice colour and idea, but would have preferred a simpler composition. And unlucky that the rabbit is sitting in that shadow where he gets a bit muted in the image.', '2006-06-13 16:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513296, 342616, 46314, '<td valign="top">A few distractions in the composition, but then I guess shooting live animals takes some of the control over composition away. Beautiful reptile.</td>', 'A few distractions in the composition, but then I guess shooting live animals takes some of the control over composition away. Beautiful reptile.', '2006-06-13 16:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513300, 343290, 46314, '<td valign="top">He seems like he''s clinging on for dear life... In that sense I like the way the blade of grass masks out his head - allows me to imagine a strained expression on his little insect face.</td>', 'He seems like he''s clinging on for dear life... In that sense I like the way the blade of grass masks out his head - allows me to imagine a strained expression on his little insect face.', '2006-06-13 16:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513301, 344238, 46314, '<td valign="top">Ewww... but good for a laugh. Did anyone eat that?</td>', 'Ewww... but good for a laugh. Did anyone eat that?', '2006-06-13 16:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513307, 344200, 46314, '<td valign="top">I know it''s a matter of taste, but I find the colours a bit muted in this shot. Especially with the green theme, I wish the leaves had some more punch in their greenness, and a bold red rose to contrast that.</td>', 'I know it''s a matter of taste, but I find the colours a bit muted in this shot. Especially with the green theme, I wish the leaves had some more punch in their greenness, and a bold red rose to contrast that.', '2006-06-13 16:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513310, 343628, 48094, '<td valign="top">Cute picture. I''d like to see his face lit better.</td>', 'Cute picture. I''d like to see his face lit better.', '2006-06-13 16:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513313, 343536, 46314, '<td valign="top">Awesome detail. I love the metallic green.</td>', 'Awesome detail. I love the metallic green.', '2006-06-13 16:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513324, 344369, 46314, '<td valign="top">Wow. Very nice lines. Even despite the square crop, the vertical lines of the trees and peaks, mirrored in the water, give a real feeling of height and space to the shot. <br/>Only thing I would have preferred was colour in the backdrop - a nice blue sky.</td>', 'Wow. Very nice lines. Even despite the square crop, the vertical lines of the trees and peaks, mirrored in the water, give a real feeling of height and space to the shot. Only thing I would have preferred was colour in the backdrop - a nice blue sky.', '2006-06-13 16:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513338, 342096, 46314, '<td valign="top">Wish the boat hadn''t been cut off, but I suppose the composition allows for the shadow in the water, which seems to highlight the green water nicely (uniform greenness might have been lost as our eyes tend to create their own ''white balance'' sometimes).<br/>But a pity the sky got blown out.</td>', 'Wish the boat hadn''t been cut off, but I suppose the composition allows for the shadow in the water, which seems to highlight the green water nicely (uniform greenness might have been lost as our eyes tend to create their own ''white balance'' sometimes).But a pity the sky got blown out.', '2006-06-13 16:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513345, 344497, 46314, '<td valign="top">The ''Green'' Victoria? :-)</td>', 'The ''Green'' Victoria? :-)', '2006-06-13 16:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513347, 344438, 46314, '<td valign="top">So far the best limes I''ve seen, although I''m on 77 of 450 "Green" entries now, so I''m sure there''ll be more...</td>', 'So far the best limes I''ve seen, although I''m on 77 of 450 "Green" entries now, so I''m sure there''ll be more...', '2006-06-13 16:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513349, 344373, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and to an extent well executed. Just needed sharper focus.</td>', 'Nice idea, and to an extent well executed. Just needed sharper focus.', '2006-06-13 16:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513353, 344472, 46314, '<td valign="top">This shot could have benefitted greatly by taken it closer to sunset/sunrise. The high overhead sun has forced you to use a faster shutter speed, and has also blown out the highlights on the falls a bit.<br/>In late afternoon in lower light, with a slower shutter, you might have been able to make the water more interesting (silky and blurred), and could have got more colour out of the more subdued lighting (richer greens).</td>', 'This shot could have benefitted greatly by taken it closer to sunset/sunrise. The high overhead sun has forced you to use a faster shutter speed, and has also blown out the highlights on the falls a bit.In late afternoon in lower light, with a slower shutter, you might have been able to make the water more interesting (silky and blurred), and could have got more colour out of the more subdued lighting (richer greens).', '2006-06-13 16:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513357, 344277, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The slight barrel distortion from the wide angle gives a sense of movement to the clouds. Good exposure too.</td>', 'Very nice. The slight barrel distortion from the wide angle gives a sense of movement to the clouds. Good exposure too.', '2006-06-13 16:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513368, 343072, 46314, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred more saturated colour, but that is a personal preference. The way it''s shot now gives it a slightly more delicate feel, a pastel mood. Nice.</td>', 'I would have preferred more saturated colour, but that is a personal preference. The way it''s shot now gives it a slightly more delicate feel, a pastel mood. Nice.', '2006-06-13 16:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513374, 342356, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea. The green dress really does look stunning. Sharp focus shows up the delicate fabrics well. Perhaps could have been improved by levelling the shot a bit more, instead of having the hanger rail falling diagonally off at the top.</td>', 'Very creative idea. The green dress really does look stunning. Sharp focus shows up the delicate fabrics well. Perhaps could have been improved by levelling the shot a bit more, instead of having the hanger rail falling diagonally off at the top.', '2006-06-13 17:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513376, 344290, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and contrast. Love the way the edges ''glow''...</td>', 'Very nice lighting and contrast. Love the way the edges ''glow''...', '2006-06-13 17:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513381, 343187, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. And I''ve always been a fan of this desaturated look.</td>', 'Very nice composition. And I''ve always been a fan of this desaturated look.', '2006-06-13 17:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513386, 342456, 46314, '<td valign="top">Creepy. I''m not a fan of snakes, but I like this shot - the S-bend of it''s body is such a bold shape in the photograph. Perhaps a smaller aperture to increase the depth of field so that the S-curve was in sharp focus too?</td>', 'Creepy. I''m not a fan of snakes, but I like this shot - the S-bend of it''s body is such a bold shape in the photograph. Perhaps a smaller aperture to increase the depth of field so that the S-curve was in sharp focus too?', '2006-06-13 17:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513390, 341725, 46314, '<td valign="top">I like the lines. The curves are almost mesmerising.</td>', 'I like the lines. The curves are almost mesmerising.', '2006-06-13 17:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513396, 343187, 17099, '<td valign="top">great shot!</td>', 'great shot!', '2006-06-13 17:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513397, 344328, 46314, '<td valign="top">How did you do this?</td>', 'How did you do this?', '2006-06-13 17:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513399, 342669, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. Like the translusence.</td>', 'Nice lighting. Like the translusence.', '2006-06-13 17:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513401, 343100, 46314, '<td valign="top">Like the composition. The delicate lattice work on the wings is contrasted by the bold green shapes of the body and stem of the plant.</td>', 'Like the composition. The delicate lattice work on the wings is contrasted by the bold green shapes of the body and stem of the plant.', '2006-06-13 17:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513403, 343951, 46314, '<td valign="top">The green lost out to the harsh sunlight sadly...</td>', 'The green lost out to the harsh sunlight sadly...', '2006-06-13 17:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513405, 344307, 46314, '<td valign="top">Good eye for patterns...</td>', 'Good eye for patterns...', '2006-06-13 17:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513407, 344433, 60443, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus. Love the bug!</td>', 'Very nice focus. Love the bug!', '2006-06-13 17:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513408, 344058, 46314, '<td valign="top">Bold lines of colour, needed sharper focus I think.</td>', 'Bold lines of colour, needed sharper focus I think.', '2006-06-13 17:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513409, 343511, 60443, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the differences in depth.</td>', 'Love the colors and the differences in depth.', '2006-06-13 17:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513410, 343602, 60443, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! One of my favorities.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice capture! One of my favorities.  Good luck!', '2006-06-13 17:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513411, 344404, 46314, '<td valign="top">Like the curvy lines, highlighted by the glow on the edges.</td>', 'Like the curvy lines, highlighted by the glow on the edges.', '2006-06-13 17:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513412, 344377, 60443, '<td valign="top">Nice open field. Love it!</td>', 'Nice open field. Love it!', '2006-06-13 17:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513414, 344412, 60443, '<td valign="top">This is funny. One of my favorites.</td>', 'This is funny. One of my favorites.', '2006-06-13 17:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513416, 342615, 60443, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast and all the interest in the photography. One of my top choices.</td>', 'Love the contrast and all the interest in the photography. One of my top choices.', '2006-06-13 17:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513417, 344417, 60443, '<td valign="top">This is very interesting. I love the creativety.</td>', 'This is very interesting. I love the creativety.', '2006-06-13 17:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513418, 341620, 60443, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful bird. Love this one!</td>', 'What a beautiful bird. Love this one!', '2006-06-13 17:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513419, 342677, 60443, '<td valign="top">Very pretty! Lots of interest in the photograph</td>', 'Very pretty! Lots of interest in the photograph', '2006-06-13 17:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513420, 342693, 60443, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrast and saturation. Love this one!</td>', 'Beautiful contrast and saturation. Love this one!', '2006-06-13 17:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513421, 342926, 46314, '<td valign="top">One of the funniest in this challenge.</td>', 'One of the funniest in this challenge.', '2006-06-13 17:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513422, 342214, 60443, '<td valign="top">This is very interstesting. Never seen one like it before. Good capture!</td>', 'This is very interstesting. Never seen one like it before. Good capture!', '2006-06-13 17:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513425, 344438, 60443, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite kiwi photograph. I wish you could have covered the little bit of white on the bottom right, but it still is very good!</td>', 'This is my favorite kiwi photograph. I wish you could have covered the little bit of white on the bottom right, but it still is very good!', '2006-06-13 17:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513427, 344344, 60443, '<td valign="top">Just like a postcard! Great!</td>', 'Just like a postcard! Great!', '2006-06-13 17:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513428, 342836, 60443, '<td valign="top">When I scrolled down to see that little surprise, it was wonderful! Nice work.</td>', 'When I scrolled down to see that little surprise, it was wonderful! Nice work.', '2006-06-13 17:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513429, 342512, 60443, '<td valign="top">Nice looking capture. Very good focus.</td>', 'Nice looking capture. Very good focus.', '2006-06-13 17:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513430, 343536, 60443, '<td valign="top">Very good DOF on this one. Nice work!</td>', 'Very good DOF on this one. Nice work!', '2006-06-13 17:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513431, 342246, 60443, '<td valign="top">The background really makes this one pop. Good work.</td>', 'The background really makes this one pop. Good work.', '2006-06-13 17:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513435, 343628, 60443, '<td valign="top">A sweet bulldog. Love those dogs!</td>', 'A sweet bulldog. Love those dogs!', '2006-06-13 17:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513436, 343943, 60443, '<td valign="top">Nice big capture of beauty!</td>', 'Nice big capture of beauty!', '2006-06-13 17:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513437, 342215, 60443, '<td valign="top">Very good DOF on this bug. Nice work!</td>', 'Very good DOF on this bug. Nice work!', '2006-06-13 17:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513438, 344277, 60443, '<td valign="top">Beautiful greens and blues. Great capture!</td>', 'Beautiful greens and blues. Great capture!', '2006-06-13 17:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513504, 344175, 51900, '<td valign="top">great idea.<br/> <br/>but u definately should have done something to make the green stand out. It''s not rich, or vibrant, or anything differrent.<br/> <br/>Maybe grey the hands, or raise the green in the RGB filter.<br/> <br/>7 for effort</td>', 'great idea. but u definately should have done something to make the green stand out. It''s not rich, or vibrant, or anything differrent. Maybe grey the hands, or raise the green in the RGB filter. 7 for effort', '2006-06-13 17:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513520, 344373, 60281, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. To me the inverted face in the bead needed to be pin sharp to make it the focal point. With a sharper image and better contrast I would have rated this picture quite highly. Stronger diffused lighting and more accurate focus are all that are lacking.</td>', 'I like the composition. To me the inverted face in the bead needed to be pin sharp to make it the focal point. With a sharper image and better contrast I would have rated this picture quite highly. Stronger diffused lighting and more accurate focus are all that are lacking.', '2006-06-13 17:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513547, 341310, 60281, '<td valign="top">The border is too wide for me and a splash of colour may have helped.</td>', 'The border is too wide for me and a splash of colour may have helped.', '2006-06-13 18:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513557, 344344, 14763, '<td valign="top">Great Photo!!!   10</td>', 'Great Photo!!!   10', '2006-06-13 18:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513567, 344062, 60281, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred it if the hole / gap was off centre. My eye is drawn straight to that gap but is disappointed to find nothing there. If you could have found a position that placed something in the gap, an interesting branch or whatever, then I would have gained the rewarded my eye was seeking.</td>', 'I would have preferred it if the hole / gap was off centre. My eye is drawn straight to that gap but is disappointed to find nothing there. If you could have found a position that placed something in the gap, an interesting branch or whatever, then I would have gained the rewarded my eye was seeking.', '2006-06-13 18:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513573, 343187, 18080, '<td valign="top">A big fat 10 from me for the fantastic shot.<br/>Great muted green colours and fantastic fun ''pose''<br/>Good luck<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'A big fat 10 from me for the fantastic shot.Great muted green colours and fantastic fun ''pose''Good luck Kev', '2006-06-13 18:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513582, 344310, 60281, '<td valign="top">An interesting picture. The horse blends into the background though, which robs it of impact. Another angle may have helped, perhaps down very low and closer in with a wide angle would have placed at least the horses head against the sky if no other contrasting background could be found. Its a shame that the rear of the plough has been clipped off.</td>', 'An interesting picture. The horse blends into the background though, which robs it of impact. Another angle may have helped, perhaps down very low and closer in with a wide angle would have placed at least the horses head against the sky if no other contrasting background could be found. Its a shame that the rear of the plough has been clipped off.', '2006-06-13 18:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513597, 341674, 60281, '<td valign="top">I like the trees. Somehow I feel that I should want to follow the path but it just isnt drawing me in. A much lower (or higher) camera position may have helped. If you had been further towards the left of the path I suspect more of the distant part would have been visible drawing me deeper into the picture.</td>', 'I like the trees. Somehow I feel that I should want to follow the path but it just isnt drawing me in. A much lower (or higher) camera position may have helped. If you had been further towards the left of the path I suspect more of the distant part would have been visible drawing me deeper into the picture.', '2006-06-13 18:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513603, 344325, 60281, '<td valign="top">Its a shame the sky is so flat and dull. Its a nice subject that needs a little more vibrance  perhaps a <i>small </i>boost of contrast would help. The foreground starts to far away for me. A lower camera position would have helped with that.</td>', 'Its a shame the sky is so flat and dull. Its a nice subject that needs a little more vibrance  perhaps a small boost of contrast would help. The foreground starts to far away for me. A lower camera position would have helped with that.', '2006-06-13 18:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513615, 342169, 60281, '<td valign="top">I like the shadows and the patterns on the leaf. It may have been better if the whole leaf was visible. The small distraction of light background in the bottom left corner could likely of been lost with a small change in camera position.</td>', 'I like the shadows and the patterns on the leaf. It may have been better if the whole leaf was visible. The small distraction of light background in the bottom left corner could likely of been lost with a small change in camera position.', '2006-06-13 18:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513635, 343116, 40370, '<td valign="top">Technically wonderful. The way you''ve filled the frame is especially appealing. The neon quality of the green cloth is a bit intense, I can imagine a softer green, closer to the color of her eyes, would be a great compliment to this image. Well done for the challenge. bUMP 10</td>', 'Technically wonderful. The way you''ve filled the frame is especially appealing. The neon quality of the green cloth is a bit intense, I can imagine a softer green, closer to the color of her eyes, would be a great compliment to this image. Well done for the challenge. bUMP 10', '2006-06-13 18:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513668, 343916, 60281, '<td valign="top">Nice picture and range of colours  not to sure about the posts though. Maybe try cropping them off. The colours would have been even more vibrant with a little less exposure. There doesnt seem to be any deep shadows because of the slight over exposure, so the image lacks punch.</td>', 'Nice picture and range of colours  not to sure about the posts though. Maybe try cropping them off. The colours would have been even more vibrant with a little less exposure. There doesnt seem to be any deep shadows because of the slight over exposure, so the image lacks punch.', '2006-06-13 19:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513691, 342457, 60281, '<td valign="top">A nice composition, especially the way the fence starts in one corner and the road in the other. The picture is a little overexposed though. The road and trees in the sunlight have burnt out. The cameras light meter was likely fooled by the shady foreground  strong sunlight and shadows can be very tricky.</td>', 'A nice composition, especially the way the fence starts in one corner and the road in the other. The picture is a little overexposed though. The road and trees in the sunlight have burnt out. The cameras light meter was likely fooled by the shady foreground  strong sunlight and shadows can be very tricky.', '2006-06-13 19:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513844, 342867, 60281, '<td valign="top">Great shot  I could just eat an apple about now!<br/> <br/>I see no deep shadows though. It has a lack of contrast that I suspect has come from adjusting brightness/contrast on an out of calibration monitor. It''s a real shame ''cause it''s great otherwise :(<br/> <br/>If the triangle of shadow on the right looks black and featureless on your display then I think your monitor need calibrating.</td>', 'Great shot  I could just eat an apple about now! I see no deep shadows though. It has a lack of contrast that I suspect has come from adjusting brightness/contrast on an out of calibration monitor. It''s a real shame ''cause it''s great otherwise :( If the triangle of shadow on the right looks black and featureless on your display then I think your monitor need calibrating.', '2006-06-13 20:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513856, 344068, 60281, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Love the colours. I should imagine it took a lot of work to produce.<br/> <br/>The lack of sharpness lets an otherwise superb image down. Is it motion blur or focus do you think? I think it may be focus, the ripple in the droplets shadow looks quite sharp  it still may be motion blur as that part of the image has the lowest velocity from the cameras view point.</td>', 'Nice shot. Love the colours. I should imagine it took a lot of work to produce. The lack of sharpness lets an otherwise superb image down. Is it motion blur or focus do you think? I think it may be focus, the ripple in the droplets shadow looks quite sharp  it still may be motion blur as that part of the image has the lowest velocity from the cameras view point.', '2006-06-13 20:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513881, 344484, 60281, '<td valign="top">Dunno what it is but I like it.<br/>Upside down, longish exposure image of water going down a plug hole (turns monitor upside down)?<br/> <br/>Could do with more punch - a shade more contrast maybe? Not sure.</td>', 'Dunno what it is but I like it.Upside down, longish exposure image of water going down a plug hole (turns monitor upside down)? Could do with more punch - a shade more contrast maybe? Not sure.', '2006-06-13 20:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513891, 344182, 60281, '<td valign="top">It''s fun, it''s green and it''s meaningless - I like it.<br/> <br/>Perhaps one facing the wrong way would have been amusing, for no apparent reason. Then again it may have just looked silly!</td>', 'It''s fun, it''s green and it''s meaningless - I like it. Perhaps one facing the wrong way would have been amusing, for no apparent reason. Then again it may have just looked silly!', '2006-06-13 21:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513895, 344412, 60281, '<td valign="top">Love those eyes!<br/>The blank background and offset subject are spot on. Only one thing spoils it and that is the halo, probably from USM around the eyelashes. I suspect the eyelashes dont need to be so sharp  as it is they are fighting with the eyes for my attention and I know which one I would like to see win. If it wasnt for that it would have been perfect to me.</td>', 'Love those eyes!The blank background and offset subject are spot on. Only one thing spoils it and that is the halo, probably from USM around the eyelashes. I suspect the eyelashes dont need to be so sharp  as it is they are fighting with the eyes for my attention and I know which one I would like to see win. If it wasnt for that it would have been perfect to me.', '2006-06-13 21:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
