(2514641, 342214, 58430, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the votes...this was my first time ever to enter any type of photography contest and I am very happy with being in the top 20 out of 450 entries.<br/> <br/>I have an obsession with my saltwater aquarium and I love to take pictures of the corals in it...That was why I bought my Rebel XT in the first place. <br/> <br/>Again, I know there are some technical flaws due to dust in the water floating by while using a prolonged exposure...but I could not do anything about it.</td>', 'Thank you for all the votes...this was my first time ever to enter any type of photography contest and I am very happy with being in the top 20 out of 450 entries. I have an obsession with my saltwater aquarium and I love to take pictures of the corals in it...That was why I bought my Rebel XT in the first place.  Again, I know there are some technical flaws due to dust in the water floating by while using a prolonged exposure...but I could not do anything about it.', '2006-06-14 01:19:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2514643, 342614, 34659, '<td valign="top">I''m floored...  I still think this was the best shot in the challenge.  You were robbed.  Beautiful work.</td>', 'I''m floored...  I still think this was the best shot in the challenge.  You were robbed.  Beautiful work.', '2006-06-14 01:19:38.000000', NULL, 0),
