(2515662, 344238, 60383, '<td valign="top">Never seen eggwhites with that texture, also never heard of yolk turning seethrough by adding colour to it. Seems to me that it''s mayonaise and yello. As for the ham I can''t really figure it out, but reminds me of a pancake with a thin layer of yello on top. <br/> <br/>Not saying you didn''t use food dye on eggs and ham as you claim, but those are some odd eggs. I smell fish!<br/> <br/>-</td>', 'Never seen eggwhites with that texture, also never heard of yolk turning seethrough by adding colour to it. Seems to me that it''s mayonaise and yello. As for the ham I can''t really figure it out, but reminds me of a pancake with a thin layer of yello on top.  Not saying you didn''t use food dye on eggs and ham as you claim, but those are some odd eggs. I smell fish! -', '2006-06-14 08:36:43.000000', NULL, 0),
