(2516776, 343261, 48339, '<td valign="top">cheers neighbor! nice score, i think we both should have done better. always next time.. right?  my take on your shot was on the low end (4) sorry.  i liked the splash a lot, but the choice of a brown bottle and the heavy reflection off of the bottle were too much. i think a green or clear bottle would have been more effective, though that reflection is always difficult to deal with (no studio).  also all that movement never lets your eye settle into the shot, for instance if the bottle had perfect/crisp focus and appeared motionless (yours is close but a little fuzzy) it may have had more impact.  otherwise...like i said we both should have done better.  happy 21st to your son. peace.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-14 13:10:59.</i></td>', 'cheers neighbor! nice score, i think we both should have done better. always next time.. right?  my take on your shot was on the low end (4) sorry.  i liked the splash a lot, but the choice of a brown bottle and the heavy reflection off of the bottle were too much. i think a green or clear bottle would have been more effective, though that reflection is always difficult to deal with (no studio).  also all that movement never lets your eye settle into the shot, for instance if the bottle had perfect/crisp focus and appeared motionless (yours is close but a little fuzzy) it may have had more impact.  otherwise...like i said we both should have done better.  happy 21st to your son. peace.', '2006-06-14 14:09:42.000000', '2006-06-14 14:10:59.000000', 0),
