(2522878, 341348, 31794, '<td valign="top">[[trading post]] <br/> <br/>composition is good, dof is a bit to shallow, the wings on the right seem out of focus.<br/>the background is way to busy, and there is a straw or wire on the right that''s really distracting.<br/> <br/>the colors are nice and that''s a beautiful bug.... if a bug can be beautiful ;)</td>', '[[trading post]]  composition is good, dof is a bit to shallow, the wings on the right seem out of focus.the background is way to busy, and there is a straw or wire on the right that''s really distracting. the colors are nice and that''s a beautiful bug.... if a bug can be beautiful ;)', '2006-06-16 16:39:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2522888, 342960, 31794, '<td valign="top">[[trading post]] <br/> <br/>as an image this is pretty well done, but I find it rather uninteresting, maby because Kermit never found his fame in Iceland so we have no emotions when we see him, he''s just another stuffed sock to us ;)<br/> <br/>composition, color and focus all seem very good, and I think that has a lot to do with the high score you got.</td>', '[[trading post]]  as an image this is pretty well done, but I find it rather uninteresting, maby because Kermit never found his fame in Iceland so we have no emotions when we see him, he''s just another stuffed sock to us ;) composition, color and focus all seem very good, and I think that has a lot to do with the high score you got.', '2006-06-16 16:46:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2523383, 341348, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>   I love bug shots. I think you did an excellent job of this and should have scored higher. Excellent detail on the left side of the wings. The bokeh is good. The only distraction is that one small branch sticking up to the right.</td>', 'Trading post...   I love bug shots. I think you did an excellent job of this and should have scored higher. Excellent detail on the left side of the wings. The bokeh is good. The only distraction is that one small branch sticking up to the right.', '2006-06-16 22:07:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2523386, 342960, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  Great score! This is a cool picture. BTW- I read your post on retiring Kermit. I think he might still have some life left in him, you never know. Really you have a great imagination (something I seem to be lacking lately). Technically this is an excellent shot as well.</td>', 'Trading post...  Great score! This is a cool picture. BTW- I read your post on retiring Kermit. I think he might still have some life left in him, you never know. Really you have a great imagination (something I seem to be lacking lately). Technically this is an excellent shot as well.', '2006-06-16 22:11:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2523390, 343734, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  Wow! It''s very green! I know from experience that it probably is really that color. Most people probably think you manipulated it to be that way which might have hurt your score. I love gator shots btw. I didn''t vote in this challenge but would have given this a 9.</td>', 'Trading post...  Wow! It''s very green! I know from experience that it probably is really that color. Most people probably think you manipulated it to be that way which might have hurt your score. I love gator shots btw. I didn''t vote in this challenge but would have given this a 9.', '2006-06-16 22:18:12.000000', NULL, 0),
