d to give feedback, so try to leave details of what you did next time. But basically it needs a lot more contrast. Some playing with selective colours would also be beneficial to bring out the colours you want. Overall it''s a great first submission, and i hope to see more :). I''ve been very direct and to the point in this critique, but don''t take it as an insult, i just want to offer you more ways of improving.', '2006-06-18 22:56:37.000000', NULL, 0),
