(2537439, 342926, 5885, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jaded_youth:</b></div><hr/><i> im NOT part of the critque club so this is just my unofficial opinion. obviously the sensor dust is distracting but also the lighting is harsh and left some dark shadows. i also think it feels a bit cramped on the right hand side. could use a little extra space before the border. speaking of which i do not think the border was a good choice for this one. on a happier note i like the subject. it was a very cute idea. ive been told that toys dont tend to score too well overall though and that may have had something to do with your score. hope that helps<br/> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree 100% with this critique. I''d add that the image seems a bit over-saturated also.</td>', 'Originally posted by jaded_youth: im NOT part of the critque club so this is just my unofficial opinion. obviously the sensor dust is distracting but also the lighting is harsh and left some dark shadows. i also think it feels a bit cramped on the right hand side. could use a little extra space before the border. speaking of which i do not think the border was a good choice for this one. on a happier note i like the subject. it was a very cute idea. ive been told that toys dont tend to score too well overall though and that may have had something to do with your score. hope that helps   I agree 100% with this critique. I''d add that the image seems a bit over-saturated also.', '2006-06-21 17:25:01.000000', NULL, 0),
