(2537987, 342925, 54702, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of the comments.  I''m afraid I misread the rules about using levels.  I have since cropped and adjusted the contrast of the image and I am quite pleased with how it came out:<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//i5.photobucket.com/albums/y195/goodbyefeet/IMG_2849-1.jpg'', strrpos(''//i5.photobucket.com/albums/y195/goodbyefeet/IMG_2849-1.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//i5.photobucket.com/albums/y195/goodbyefeet/IMG_2849-1.jpg"/></td>', 'Thanks for all of the comments.  I''m afraid I misread the rules about using levels.  I have since cropped and adjusted the contrast of the image and I am quite pleased with how it came out: ', '2006-06-21 19:55:35.000000', NULL, 0),
