(2548950, 341674, 30454, '<td valign="top">Greetings from your own critique club.<br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b> <br/>Very Nice shot, with WOW factor. <br/><b>Composition:</b> <br/>Very good composition. Just wondering if it would have looked even better with camera even lower on the ground. <br/><b>Subject:</b> <br/>I really like the subject. Very nice green rein forest colors. Just Wonderful<br/><b>Technical (Colour and light):</b> <br/>Great colors and lighting with perfect exposure. <br/><b>Improvement:</b> <br/>Nothing but just one thing. Shot from little lower almost on the road without any tripod.<br/><b>Summary:</b> <br/>Nice over all picture. I really liked it and firmly believe it deserves better than what it got.<br/> <br/>Congrates on very nice image. Keep shooting...Cheers!!</td>', 'Greetings from your own critique club. First Impression Very Nice shot, with WOW factor. Composition: Very good composition. Just wondering if it would have looked even better with camera even lower on the ground. Subject: I really like the subject. Very nice green rein forest colors. Just WonderfulTechnical (Colour and light): Great colors and lighting with perfect exposure. Improvement: Nothing but just one thing. Shot from little lower almost on the road without any tripod.Summary: Nice over all picture. I really liked it and firmly believe it deserves better than what it got. Congrates on very nice image. Keep shooting...Cheers!!', '2006-06-24 15:57:18.000000', NULL, 0),
