(2692188, 342456, 40355, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, and even with the 6+ score, I think you were robbed.  The composition is interesting, especially with the contrast between the curves in the snake and the stright edges in the leaves.  The lighting is a touch harsh in a few spots, but overall, it''s a great capture.</td>', 'This is a great shot, and even with the 6+ score, I think you were robbed.  The composition is interesting, especially with the contrast between the curves in the snake and the stright edges in the leaves.  The lighting is a touch harsh in a few spots, but overall, it''s a great capture.', '2006-08-03 13:24:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2693655, 343784, 63249, '<td valign="top">How appropriate is this shot in today''s world?  Nicely done with the juxtapositioning...if only we had Mobil''s profits to spread around ;-&gt;</td>', 'How appropriate is this shot in today''s world?  Nicely done with the juxtapositioning...if only we had Mobil''s profits to spread around ;->', '2006-08-03 21:44:27.000000', NULL, 0),
