(2743749, 344062, 60779, '<td valign="top">Well, I''m on my laptop and can''t figure out why your mode score was 5. I think this is well done and original. The processing is perfect.</td>', 'Well, I''m on my laptop and can''t figure out why your mode score was 5. I think this is well done and original. The processing is perfect.', '2006-08-20 15:37:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2773976, 343511, 714, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent image! so cute!</td>', 'This is an excellent image! so cute!', '2006-08-30 10:14:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2800085, 342456, 42871, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the kind words! I agree that its over noise reduced and the lighting was not the best. The fact is that I wasnt even thinking of the challenge when I took this picture. I had taken a different picture to use in the green challange but it hadnt come out. This was the only other thing green I had taken. Had I planned the shot better I would have zoomed in much closer and worked at a better composition. As it was I had to crop so much of it that the final image was incredibly noisy and needed some extra passes, which obliterated some of the detail. A great learning experience tho, the words of my high school photography teacher still ringing in my ears; "fill the frame". Now they actually have meaning for me, Photoshop cant fix everything ;)</td>', 'Thanks for the kind words! I agree that its over noise reduced and the lighting was not the best. The fact is that I wasnt even thinking of the challenge when I took this picture. I had taken a different picture to use in the green challange but it hadnt come out. This was the only other thing green I had taken. Had I planned the shot better I would have zoomed in much closer and worked at a better composition. As it was I had to crop so much of it that the final image was incredibly noisy and needed some extra passes, which obliterated some of the detail. A great learning experience tho, the words of my high school photography teacher still ringing in my ears; "fill the frame". Now they actually have meaning for me, Photoshop cant fix everything ;)', '2006-09-05 10:58:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2805655, 342512, 9285, '<td valign="top">Perfect... :) I love the say the colour captivates me... <br/>Soothing shot.. :)</td>', 'Perfect... :) I love the say the colour captivates me... Soothing shot.. :)', '2006-09-06 14:13:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2805691, 344404, 9285, '<td valign="top">Hi Sherryl,<br/> <br/>I''ve always been a big fan of your artwork and wanted to start commenting on one of my many fav shots of yours..<br/> <br/>I simply love this shot.. it has a very soothing and calming effect on me.. It''s perfect in my opinion and I had a sense of serenity when I look at it.. <br/> <br/>Thanks for the beautiful image..<br/> <br/>Cheers.<br/>Eric</td>', 'Hi Sherryl, I''ve always been a big fan of your artwork and wanted to start commenting on one of my many fav shots of yours.. I simply love this shot.. it has a very soothing and calming effect on me.. It''s perfect in my opinion and I had a sense of serenity when I look at it..  Thanks for the beautiful image.. Cheers.Eric', '2006-09-06 14:21:58.000000', NULL, 0),
