(2996459, 344404, 20324, '<td valign="top">I went to Banana Republic store today with my wife and I saw a picture of an agave on its wall. (Now days I dont mind walking with my family to malls since I pay more attention to the walls with pictures then shelves in stores. My girls just stated that they were surprised how well I behave in stores with them recently. I dont hurry up them anymore.) I immediately thought about your pictures of agaves. I think that they are much better than the one I saw on the wall in BR.<br/> <br/>I like particularly this one. Good job!!!<br/></td>', 'I went to Banana Republic store today with my wife and I saw a picture of an agave on its wall. (Now days I dont mind walking with my family to malls since I pay more attention to the walls with pictures then shelves in stores. My girls just stated that they were surprised how well I behave in stores with them recently. I dont hurry up them anymore.) I immediately thought about your pictures of agaves. I think that they are much better than the one I saw on the wall in BR. I like particularly this one. Good job!!!', '2006-11-03 23:19:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3011395, 343603, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful! I like the way her features are visible even though they are covered. And the pendant really makes the shot. My eyes circle the image counter-clockwise: from the lips up to the eyes, then the pendant, and back down around the folds of the scarf to the lips again.</td>', 'This is beautiful! I like the way her features are visible even though they are covered. And the pendant really makes the shot. My eyes circle the image counter-clockwise: from the lips up to the eyes, then the pendant, and back down around the folds of the scarf to the lips again.', '2006-11-07 18:53:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3041600, 342615, 66635, '<td valign="top">I''m looking at the breakdown of scores on this.  How the hell could anyone give this incredible picture a 1? 2? 3? 4?  This is one of the best pictures on this site.  It''s an obvious 10!  I''d give it a 20!  Really, who the hell gave this shot a 1?  It must have been someone who thought of your shot as competing with theirs.  Unbelievable!</td>', 'I''m looking at the breakdown of scores on this.  How the hell could anyone give this incredible picture a 1? 2? 3? 4?  This is one of the best pictures on this site.  It''s an obvious 10!  I''d give it a 20!  Really, who the hell gave this shot a 1?  It must have been someone who thought of your shot as competing with theirs.  Unbelievable!', '2006-11-18 05:36:52.000000', NULL, 0),
