(3077229, 344425, 31244, '<td valign="top">Owen, I think this image exemplifies your inner strife -- eating at you like a thousand green sweatshirts.  You look very depressesed, and I can only guess it is because of your choice of clothing; perhaps a bully at school gave you some grief about it.  Also, if your thumb wasn''t in the picture, then I think you would have scored even better, but it wasn''t to be.  Possibly another reason for your melancholy pose is that you realized what you said about Grant being anywhere near our intellectual level was quite an absurd and potentially hurtfull thing to say.  I mean, someone who can''t even realize that a throw from a football was overthrown, rather than my legs failing to work, is obviously borderline mentally retarded.  Well I apologize about the pictures score and I''m just sorry that the public has to see it.<br/> <br/>x (hug), x (hug), o (kiss), X (big hug), o (little kiss), O (big kiss),<br/>Adam</td>', 'Owen, I think this image exemplifies your inner strife -- eating at you like a thousand green sweatshirts.  You look very depressesed, and I can only guess it is because of your choice of clothing; perhaps a bully at school gave you some grief about it.  Also, if your thumb wasn''t in the picture, then I think you would have scored even better, but it wasn''t to be.  Possibly another reason for your melancholy pose is that you realized what you said about Grant being anywhere near our intellectual level was quite an absurd and potentially hurtfull thing to say.  I mean, someone who can''t even realize that a throw from a football was overthrown, rather than my legs failing to work, is obviously borderline mentally retarded.  Well I apologize about the pictures score and I''m just sorry that the public has to see it. x (hug), x (hug), o (kiss), X (big hug), o (little kiss), O (big kiss),Adam', '2006-12-01 00:14:29.000000', NULL, 0),
