(3277388, 343609, 14986, '<td valign="top">I think bird shots are very hard to get.  This one is very nice.  The green seems almost too bright, but it may be the natural color.  There also does seem to be a few places where it looks oversharpened in the texture.   Still, that''s nitpicking.  This is a wonderful shot.</td>', 'I think bird shots are very hard to get.  This one is very nice.  The green seems almost too bright, but it may be the natural color.  There also does seem to be a few places where it looks oversharpened in the texture.   Still, that''s nitpicking.  This is a wonderful shot.', '2007-01-24 20:12:00.000000', NULL, 0),
